---
description: |
  Lists the SOC Prime High-Order Sigma (HoS) rules of the bundled content.

  Every event has the `name` to pass to `socprime::hos::detect`, the Sigma
  rule `uid`, the `title`, the Sigma `level`, the `timeframe`, and the stages
  with their Sigma rule IDs.
---

from {hos: socprime::$hos.entries()}
unroll hos
this = {
  name: hos.key,
  uid: hos.value.uid,
  title: hos.value.name,
  level: hos.value.level,
  timeframe: hos.value.timeframe,
  stages: hos.value.stages,
}
